# Grokbit Business Studio — product plan **3.0.0**

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| **Status** | Active — thin-client Studio major |
| **Prior sketch** | [Grokbit-ui-2.0.0](Grokbit-ui-2.0.0) (historical only) |
| **Roadmap / epic Status SoT** | [grokbit-business-studio-3.0.md](grokbit-business-studio-3.0.md) |
| **Architecture** | Thin ACP client; vanilla webview; no React / React Flow / five permanent sidebar tabs |

## Goal

Ship a **chat-first Business Studio** on top of Grokbit 2.x (rebrand + native tabs + document cards):

1. **E1** Task quick-actions on welcome / empty session  
2. **E2** Workspace documents browser (popover)  
3. **E4** Template gallery v1 (~12–15, search, Use → seed)  

Generation stays in **CLI skills** (`/docx`, `/pptx`, `/xlsx`, `/imagine`). The extension owns discovery, seeds, cards, and browse UX — **not** an Office suite.

## Feature plans

| Epic | Plan |
|------|------|
| E1 | [business-quick-actions.md](business-quick-actions.md) |
| E2 | [workspace-documents-browser.md](workspace-documents-browser.md) |
| E4 | [template-gallery.md](template-gallery.md) |

## Explicit non-goals (3.0.0)

- React / Tailwind / shadcn / React Flow  
- Five always-visible sidebar tabs  
- Bundled Office engines / live Office preview  
- 50+ templates; n8n/Zapier export  
- Enterprise blue theme (use `--vscode-*` only)

## User-visible success

1. New session → business task chip → edit composer → Send  
2. Documents popover → open / reveal / attach / seed a workspace file  
3. Templates → search → Use → seed  
4. Document result cards when the agent produces office files (E0)

See roadmap release bar and epic Status in [grokbit-business-studio-3.0.md](grokbit-business-studio-3.0.md).
